'''Spitties''' are maggot-like monsters introduced in the vanilla content of ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth]]'', and can be only encountered in [[Chapter 2]].

They are much fatter than other [[maggot]] forms, possess a face like [[Charger]]s, but have only half health of a Charger. They spit a blood shot ahead of them while slowly crawling along aimlessly. They have a slow firing rate, and because they ignore Isaac, their shots are easy to avoid.

They also can be summoned by other monsters and bosses, such as the {{e|Grub}}, {{e|Pestilence}}, and {{e|Chub}}'s orange champion variant.

{{dlc|nr}} Oddly enough, they do one full heart of contact damage, despite Chargers and even Conjoined Spitties doing half heart damage.

