'''Tainted Spitties''' are exclusive to the [[Ascent]] to {{s|Home}}. They are much larger and tankier versions of regular Spitties that also move and spit faster.

They shoot blood shots out of their backs and occasionally spit out a line full of shots. Upon death, they shoot out a ring of blood shots.

